CppHeaderParser cannot parse "typedef enum {...} A, B;" (multiple
typedef names, used by HIPresourcetype_enum and friends in the hip
headers); split the second name into its own typedef before parsing.
Also handle anonymous structs/unions, which the robotpy fork names
"<anon-struct-N>" instead of the "Parent::" the old checks matched:
recurse into their fields instead of printing them directly, and skip
emitting operator<< for the anonymous types themselves.

